      "comment": "Aberaku: The Dainichi Mikoshi (Helios)",
      "content": "The Dainichi Mikoshi is the artificial sun of Enkanomiya, which Aberaku called Helios in private. Its light turned Evernight into a cycle of Whitenight and Evernight and kept the Dragonheirs of the Depths at bay. Under Orobashi's rule it was powered up so that it could be toggled at will.",
