      "comment": "Aberaku: Hyperion's Dirge",
      "content": "A World Quest chain in Enkanomiya. The Traveler completes three trials (Narrow Inquiry, Temple Inquiry, Serpent's Heart Inquiry) to collect offerings that hold his remnant thoughts, offers them, and then reaches the top of the Dainichi Mikoshi, where he recalls everything and gives them the Divine Bridle.",
